WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:04.520
<i>A fierce battle broke out between Kaito and Tron in the second match of the Semi-Finals.</i>

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:07.300
<i>But during his attacks against Tron,</i>

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.280
<i>the damage was inflicted on Haruto, and Kaito was backed into a corner psychologically.</i>

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.700
<i>and Tron finally started his counterattack!</i>

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.700
Go, Genome Heriter!

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.410
Flash Impact!

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:37.430
<i>I-I don't believe it! Dyson Sphere was...</i>

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:40.760
<i>...destroyed by Genome Heriter!</i>

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:44.550
<i>And the tables have turned to Tron's favor!</i>

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.480
<i>Kaito was cornered in an instant!</i>

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:50.850
Tron, you've really done it now.

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:53.650
Dyson Sphere was...

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:57.000
And Kaito's expression looks really odd compared to before!

00:00:57.810 --> 00:00:58.880
Something must have happened...

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:05.770
You understand, don't you?

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:08.330
My pain is Tron's pain.

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:11.330
And that means Tron's pain is my pain as well...

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:12.890
Brother.

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:17.900
<i>What?!</i>

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:20.340
<i>What is...?!</i>

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:24.930
Haruto!

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:30.220
It's a special screening especially for <i>you</i>, Brother.

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:37.560
Haruto! Stop it, you bastard!

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:43.060
Tron!

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:46.450
What are you trying to do to Haruto?!

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:50.510
Haruto! Haruto!!

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:59.870
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:05.210
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:22.060
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:27.860
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:32.450
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:38.490
<i>It's too soon for us to turn back now</i>

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:43.580
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:49.130
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:54.930
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:59.970
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:05.440
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:11.110
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:17.280
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:23.370
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.600
C'mon. It's your turn, Brother.

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:32.060
It's okay. Go on and attack me!

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.900
With your Galaxy-Eyes!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:38.740
"Number 64: Roar, Neo Galaxy-Eyes!
 The Brothers' Bond That Smashes The Darkness"

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:37.780
If you don't mind what happens to your <i>beloved</i> Haruto, that is.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:41.280
<i>If I attack him, Haruto will...</i>

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.950
<i>But if I lose...</i>

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:56.130
My turn! Draw!

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.590
<i>I just have to win!
 Winning is the only way!</i>

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:02.260
<i>I'll defeat this guy and save Haruto!</i>

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.600
<i>But will Haruto be able to endure so much pain?!</i>

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.970
I use Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.480
and attack Heraldic King Genome Heriter!

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:16.190
Photon Stream of Destruction!!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.580
That's cruel... You're cruel, Brother...

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:36.710
Genome Heriter may not be destroyed in a battle with a non-Number,

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.880
but I'm still damaged.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.920
As I thought, you'll...

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:43.510
...use any method necessary to achieve your goal.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.340
You're a horrible human being!

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:50.810
I'll end my turn with that!

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:54.440
Hey! Can't you fly any faster?

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.560
At this rate, Haruto will...!

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:58.520
Foolma! I know that already without you telling me!

00:04:58.690 --> 00:04:59.610
I'm diving in!

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:00.150
Huh?

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.440
Hang on tight!

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:15.750
As I expected, we activated the flawless security system!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.130
My turn. Draw!

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:22.880
Brother...

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:27.130
I bet you're disappointed that it's my turn and you can't attack, right?

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:31.220
But it's alright. I won't let you be disappointed.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:32.310
What?!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:37.900
I equip the Equip Magic, Cursed Medallion, to Genome Heriter!

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.020
Once per turn, both players receive...

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:45.740
... 300 points of damage for each Monster on the field!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.240
There are two Monsters on the field,

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:52.580
so both of us brothers receive 600 points of damage!

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:56.290
Let's do it together, Brother.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:17.310
Brother... Broth...

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:21.900
How can this be?!

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:24.400
Haruto...

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.360
Haruto!!

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:32.030
I can't stand this! I just can't stand it!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:34.660
Let's go!

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.550
Hey, Haruto! Get a hold of yourself!

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:47.920
Haruto! Haruto!

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:52.850
Haruto...

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:56.770
Kaito! He's okay! Haruto's still alive!

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:58.480
Can you hear me?

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:02.860
Is that so? Haruto...

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:08.190
Got you! You fell for it!

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:13.450
Surprised, are we? I bet you thought he was done for, didn't you?

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:15.370
You bastard...

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:20.500
Don't be like that. It was nothing more than a small joke.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:23.130
But the <i>real </i>drama starts now!

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:24.840
Right, "Father"?

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:31.430
Enough of this! Haruto's done nothing to you!

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:35.970
Haruto just wanted to be together with Kaito!

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:39.230
Same with Kaito.

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:43.770
He just wanted to save you, and he's only thinking about you.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.690
And despite that, why does Haruto...?

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:51.280
What's happening?

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:54.200
<i>This is...</i>

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:13.260
This is...

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:15.550
That's right.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.890
Just like that time...

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:22.600
<i>Yuma. I always believed that you guys would come here eventually.</i>

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.560
<i>I cannot get out of here.</i>

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.940
<i>Please, save my brother.</i>

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.740
That's right. This is inside Haruto's consciousness.

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:38.370
The place where Haruto summoned you before.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:39.450
Haruto...

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:42.960
What the...?!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.010
That's...

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:05.900
How...? How did you...?

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.730
So he really has been hiding inside Haruto!

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:14.530
You're always getting in my way! You're such an annoying kid!

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:19.240
Yuma!!

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:22.700
Yuma.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:24.160
I know!

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:29.340
Come forth, Number 39!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.930
Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.350
Nice work!

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:46.520
What?!

00:09:58.910 --> 00:09:59.910
Stop joking!

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:04.410
How can I allow someone like you to do what you want inside Haruto's heart?!

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.500
Go, Hope!

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:09.960
Slash the evil power rooting inside Haruto's heart!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:13.960
Hope Sword Slash!

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:20.430
Did we finish him off?

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:33.190
Yuma... Yuma!

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.160
Foolma!

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.540
Darn!

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.460
Damn you, Yuma!

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:55.550
How far do you plan to get in the way?!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:58.510
Yuma!

00:10:58.550 --> 00:10:59.430
What's going on here?

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:04.180
Hmph! I took care of Tron's consciousness inside Haruto's heart!

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:06.970
There's no connection between Haruto and Tron anymore!

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:08.730
You can relax for now, Kaito.

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:11.440
And kick that guy's butt!

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:12.810
You...

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:19.400
You are absolutely unforgivable...

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:20.530
Tron!

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.450
I hope you're ready for your repentance!

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.870
Kaito-<i>sama</i>, do your best!

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:32.420
Kaito!

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.880
Yuma, Kaito...

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:40.550
You guys never allow things to go my way, do you...?

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:44.470
Stop spouting bullshit! I'd never allow you to!

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.430
My turn! Draw!

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:50.430
I activate the Magic Card, Galaxy Expedition!

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.270
When there is a Galaxy-Eyes on my field,

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:56.440
I can Special Summon one Galaxy Knight from my deck!

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:02.240
Then, when I control a Galaxy Knight on my field,

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:06.740
I can Special Summon another Galaxy-Knight from my hand!

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:09.700
Go, Kaito!

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:14.080
I overlay the Level Eight Galaxy-Eyes and two Galaxy Knights!

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:18.880
I build the Overlay Network with these three Monsters!

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:20.380
Xyz Summon!

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:23.930
Great Galaxy of Reversal!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:29.350
Become the rolling waves of light and show your mighty form!

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:37.190
Descend, my very soul!

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:41.360
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:59.750
So this is the evolved version of Galaxy-Eyes!

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:09.010
When I summon Neo Galaxy-Eyes successfully using Galaxy-Eyes as the Overlay Unit,

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:12.270
all other Monster Effects are negated!

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.770
Photon Howling!

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:22.780
Genome Heriter's effect is...?

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:27.030
Now your Monster is nothing more than a marionette!

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:30.530
Meaning his Number can now be destroyed!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:34.160
And if this attack connects, Kaito will win!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:39.130
Tron! My anger cannot be silenced, even if you beg for forgiveness a million times!

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:42.340
I don't care if it's Hell or the Parallel Worlds!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:44.470
Just get away from Haruto and me!

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:47.300
Attack Genome Heriter!

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:50.800
Ultimate Photon Stream!!

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:58.980
He did it!

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.940
You did it, Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:08.740
Good job. I expect no less from...

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:13.160
What?

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.370
Huh?!

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:16.080
He can't be...!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.460
You thought you defeated me, right?

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:25.090
I targeted Neo Galaxy-Eyes

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:29.010
and activated the Permanent Trap, Protection Medallion!

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:30.300
What did you say?

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:37.230
That's right. Due to Protection Medallion,

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:42.190
Neo Galaxy-Eyes lost 800 Attack Points.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:44.070
N-No way...!

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:47.030
Is that why Tron's Life wasn't totally wiped out?

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:51.320
Alright, Kaito, what are you going to do?

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:54.870
I...end my turn.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.660
Thank you, Kaito.

00:14:59.420 --> 00:14:59.870
What?

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:02.420
This is all thanks to you.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:06.800
Because of your rage, the Medallion God...

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:09.630
...has awakened!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:12.180
What's that?!

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:18.770
My turn! Draw!

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:22.940
I Summon Heraldic Beast Berner's Falcon!

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:30.200
Then I activate the Magic Card, Reborn Medallion!

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:35.910
This card can Special Summon one Level Four or lower Heraldic Monster from my Graveyard!

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:40.040
I Special Summon Heraldic Beast Basilisk!

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:45.210
Then, when I control two or more Heraldic Beasts on my field,

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:49.800
I can Special Summon Heraldic Beast Yale from my hand!

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:59.100
I Overlay the Level Four Berner's Falcon, Basilisk, and Yale!

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:04.100
I build the Overlay Network using these three Monsters!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:06.270
Xyz Summon!

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.900
Rage, release yourself!

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:25.210
Come forth, Number 69!

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:31.220
God Medallion - Coat of Arms!

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.430
What's with this Number?

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:43.640
To control this guy, enormous energy is required.

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:45.520
And that energy is...

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:47.730
...rage.

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:48.860
Rage?

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:52.280
That's right. I have no emotions,

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:54.780
so I can't produce pure rage.

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:57.820
That's why I attempted to make everyone angry.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:01.790
Droite and Shark... I was even willing to utilize my sons...

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:04.410
...in order to create rage.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.250
Say what?!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.090
You did pretty well <i>too</i>!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:13.010
You get angrier and angrier when it comes to Haruto!

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:15.930
It's all thanks to <i>you</i>! Have a look!

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:18.890
I finally managed to call forth the Coat of Arms!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:24.140
Don't tell me all of this was so you could summon that Number!

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:26.270
<i>So if I were to do something like </i>this<i>...</i>

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:27.600
<i>Haruto!</i>

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:31.860
<i>Descend, my very soul!</i>

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:35.450
Tron!

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:39.160
Plus, Coat of Arms can...

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:43.290
...activate effects without using Overlay Units.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:47.870
It negates  the effects of <i>all</i> other Monsters on the field,

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:50.420
and it gains <i>all </i>of those effects!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:51.500
What?!

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:55.340
Go, Coat of Arms!

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:58.590
Snatch Neo Galaxy-Eyes' effects away!

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:01.430
God Medallion Hand!

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:16.030
That way, your Monster will lose all of its effects.

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:17.400
And they will become <i>mine</i>.

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:20.450
Neo Galaxy-Eyes...

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:22.120
Kaito!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:25.080
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:35.760
Here I come, Kaito!

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:41.430
I activate the Monster Effect stolen from Neo Galaxy-Eyes!

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:44.010
By detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:49.140
I send all Overlay Units but the ones attached to Coat of Arms to the Graveyard.

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:56.530
And now the Attack Power of Coat of Arms...

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:59.700
...goes up 500 points for every Overlay Unit sent away.

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:04.240
Thus, it gains 1500 Attack Points!

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:07.000
Then, Coat of Arms can...

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:12.500
...attack Monsters up to the same number of Overlay Units sent!

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:15.800
Which means three consecutive attacks!

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:18.800
Neo Galaxy Eyes' effects were...!

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:23.220
Also, due to Permanent Trap, Protection Medallion's, effect,

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:26.810
Neo Galaxy-Eyes cannot be destroyed!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:30.520
Let me <i>taste</i> you to my heart's content!

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:33.900
And have a good look for <i>yourself</i>, Faker!

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:36.900
The painful struggles of your son!

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:41.700
Impossible!

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:46.330
I attack Neo Galaxy-Eyes with Coat of Arms!

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:48.410
God Rage!

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.760
And again!

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:02.970
God Rage!

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:16.860
Kaito!

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:22.820
Haruto...

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:26.660
Not yet! You're not allowed to fall just <i>yet</i>!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:30.160
This wasn't the <i>extent</i> of your rage, now <i>was</i> it?!

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:32.500
God Rage!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:34.500
Kaito!

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:37.590
No!

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:49.260
What the?

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:57.520
Im... Impossible! You're...

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:04.990
Haruto.

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:09.370
Brother, thank you.

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:16.580
Haruto...

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:33.060
So he used his remaining power for the sake of his brother, huh?

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:42.320
That's terrible. Your revenge tastes awful.

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:50.740
Kaito... Kaito!

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:55.080
Hey, get a hold of yourself, Kaito! Kaito!

00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:05.340
Kaito!!

00:22:10.430 --> 00:22:15.600
